5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely that we are doing this together. I want to make sure we consider the costs and the practical side of things.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. However, we should also consider the fairness of the distribution. Some spots are naturally less desirable than others.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... maybe we should check the budget and the costs first? Just to be safe.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for a fresh start! I want to know how this actually affects our daily flow and how much time we lose.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get too emotional about ""fresh starts."" We need data on the actual environment if we want a layout that doesn't fail in a month.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, you have a point. I wonder if the billing for the floor might give us a clue on how to arrange things fairly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Perhaps. I am also interested in how we have handled these changes in the past. Patterns usually repeat themselves.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Shizue. The billing seems important.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, what do you mean by ""environment""? Like, the noise? Or the way we move around in the morning?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. Noise levels and ergonomics. It's a shame these are usually treated as afterthoughts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the billing and the quotes for the power and network. It's better to know the price of our comfort now.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the past shuffles and the staff survey. I want to see if there is a hidden bias in how we've sat.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll look into the floor billing too. And maybe the power quotes. I just want to make sure we can afford it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going for the morning routine on the pilot floor and the badge records! I want to see how people actually start their day.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the sound meter readings and the physio's note. I prefer my data to be scientific rather than based on ""feelings.""","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
