35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems that moving things around is quite costly, and we are paying for space we aren't even using.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The survey shows a strong preference for windows, yet our current plan leaves several people in the dark. We cannot ignore this.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... the billing is... it's actually quite high. We are paying for empty space. I'm worried we can't afford many changes.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,I found out that setting up every morning can take up to nine minutes! That's a lot of time when you're in a rush!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's fascinating how we ignore the physical toll. The physio's notes suggest we spend days just trying to get comfortable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, don't be too worried. If we plan carefully now, we can avoid those extra charges.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Planning carefully means deciding who gets the window and who doesn't. We should be explicit about the trade-offs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope so. But the quote for re-running power is per desk. If we move everyone, it adds up quickly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"And the badge records show we don't all arrive at the same time! If we have ""hot desks,"" the early birds get all the good ones.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Hot-desking is a nightmare for ergonomics. If I have to spend three days adjusting my chair every week, I'll lose my mind.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps we can find a middle ground where we maximize the space we already pay for without spending too much on wiring.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A middle ground often means no one is satisfied. I suggest we rotate the less desirable seats periodically.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should try to keep the changes minimal. Maybe just move the people who really need it?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we just move a few people, we might still have that morning setup lag! I want a layout that's ""plug and play.""","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"""Plug and play"" doesn't exist for the human spine, Mio. We need fixed spots that are actually optimized for the person sitting there.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us be kind to one another. We all want a place where we feel welcome and comfortable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Kindness is fine, but clarity is better. Let's see the options and decide who takes the interior wall.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I just don't want us to go over budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm sure we can find a way to be happy and fast! Let's see the plans!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be happy as long as I'm not sitting next to the printer's noise pollution.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
