60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry that Option A might make us feel like strangers in our own office. I prefer a place where we know our neighbors.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is the most ""fair"" in a superficial sense, but it creates a daily competition for the best seats. I prefer Option C.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... Option A would be the cheapest for wiring, right? Because we wouldn't need to move power for specific people...","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,No way to Option A! I saw the data! We'd waste so much time every morning just setting up. I love Option B!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is an ergonomic disaster. Option C is just a slow-motion version of the same disaster. Option B is the only rational choice.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, @Shunichi, it seems you both agree on Option B. It would certainly give us a stable home for our things.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Option B simply cements the inequality. Someone gets the window, someone gets the wall, and they stay there forever.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Option B is okay. It's quiet. I don't like the idea of moving every few months like in Option C.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,Exactly! Imagine the chaos of moving all your stuff every few months! Option B is just... cozy!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's not about ""cozy,"" Mio. It's about not having a neck cramp because you're using a desk that was set up for someone six inches taller.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we choose Option B, we can spend time now deciding who sits where, so we can all be happy neighbors.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we go with B, we must agree on a fair way to assign the interior seats. We cannot just let it happen by accident.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm okay with B. As long as we don't have to pay for too many wiring changes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,Yay! I'm definitely voting for B! It's the fastest and the most comfortable!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Finally, some common sense. I'll vote for B, provided we actually use the sound and physio data to place people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us choose the path that brings us together and gives us peace. I vote for B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will vote for C to maintain the principle of fairness, but I see the tide is turning.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for B too. It seems the safest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,B all the way!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,B. Let's get this over with.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
